- op: discuss  # 2f49
  at: '2026-05-15T00:13:38Z'  # 2f49
  by: agent  # 2f49
  actor: jgstern_agent  # 2f49
  clock: 4  # 2f49
  nonce: 2f49  # 2f49
  message: "Shipped in PR #3723. Added --show-external-potential flag to hypergumbo io-boundaries; bucket suppressed from default text output (replaced with one-line summary), but always present in JSON; --boundary external_potential also bypasses the suppression. Picked option (b) hide-by-default per the tracker's two-option spec — folding would have required a heuristic mapping from unresolved-receiver dst kind to specific IO primitives, which the existing F3 filters already explored without finding a reliable signal. Five new tests + two updated; 100% coverage; 12184 tests pass."  # 2f49
